================================================================================
Notes on third-party content
================================================================================

This repository depends on third-party libraries through pyproject.toml (pinned
via uv.lock). Each library retains its own license; see the project metadata
of each package. Notable runtime dependencies and their licenses are listed in
code/README.md.

The regtest Lightning credentials under infra/credentials/ are generated
synthetic material with no monetary value. They are included under MIT along
with the rest of infra/ purely so a reviewer can bring up the L402 path on a
fresh machine without re-running the bootstrap from scratch.
